# Trivy ignores. Keep every entry narrow, explained and time-limited.
#
# Format: one vulnerability ID or path per line.
#
# Examples:
#   CVE-2026-00000  # package@version: not reachable; review by 2026-12-31
#   docker.io/library/node:22-alpine  # base image exception; review by 2026-12-31
#
# Do not add a broad wildcard to make CI green. Fix, upgrade or document the
# risk in an issue instead.
